          "reason": "Only the enabled PatchTritonVAE branch requires Triton; this pinned LTX original enables that branch by default. It is not required for H3 or the declared Umbra API workflows. On Windows use triton-windows matched to the installed Torch minor and supported GPU; Linux uses the compatible triton distribution. Installation is held until that platform pin is reviewed. Native loading separately requires every original node class to remain registered, including bypassed stages."
